[v1.1.5] — The Expansion Update
Release Date: March 19, 2026

Added
Dynamic Event Routing: Integrated a new filtering system in Gallery.jsx to automatically pull sub-categories from Cloudinary.
JROTC Collection: Added the District Competition gallery.
Navbar Evolution: Re-engineered the desktop and mobile navigation to support nested sports categories and expanding JROTC event lists.

Refinements & Fixes
Brand Typography: Updated formatName helper to ensure "JROTC" maintains correct capitalization across the UI.
Lightbox Optimization: Enhanced image scaling logic for vertical "tuff" shots on mobile devices.
Theme Continuity: Smoothed out the 1000ms transition between Dark/Light modes on gallery pages.

